      "retried": false,
      "raw": "1) Moles of H⁺: 0.050 L × 0.0025 mol/L = 1.25e-04 mol.\n2) Moles of OH⁻: 0.050 L × 0.0023 mol/L = 1.15e-04 mol.\n3) Excess H⁺: 1.25e-04 − 1.15e-04 = 1.0e-05 mol.\n4) Total volume: 100 mL = 0.1 L.\n5) [H⁺] = 1.0e-05 mol / 0.1 L = 1e-04 mol/L.\n6) pH = −log10(1e-04) = 4.\n\nAnswer: (E)<channel|>Answer: (E)"
