      "raw": "The maximum z-component of spin angular momentum is S_z = m_s·ħ, where m_s = I = 7/2. S_ = 7/2 × 1.0545718e-34 ≈ 3.74075e-34 J·s. The closest option is (I).\n\nAnswer: (I)"
