      "want": "C",
      "got": "A",
      "ok": false,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "The Larmor frequency for 13C at 400 MHz is ω = 2π·400e6 rad/s. The pulse duration τ = 1e-6 s must satisfy τ = π/2·ω for a 90° flip angle. B1 = π/(2·ω·τ) = π/(2·2π·400e6·1e-6) = 1/1600000 ≈ 15.625e-3 T = 15.625 mT. Nejbližší možnost je (A).\n\nAnswer: (A)<channel|>Vysvětlení: Larmorova frekvence je ω = 2π·400e6 rad/s. Pro 90° pulz musí být délka pulzu τ = π/(2·ω), tedy B1 = π/(2·ω·τ) = 1/(4·400e6·1e-6) ≈ 15.625 mT. Nejbližší možnost je (A).\n\nAnswer: (A)"
    },
