      "want": "D",
      "got": "D",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "(B)\n\n1) Převod času na sekundy: t = 0.5 min × 60 = 30 s.\n2) Q = I·t = 50 A × 30 s = 1500 C.\n\nTedy 1500 coulombů.\n\nAnswer: (D)"
