      "category": "physics",
      "want": "B",
      "got": "B",
      "ok": true,
      "retried": false,
      "raw": "(B)\n\n1) g = G·M/r² = G·(4/3 π ρ r³) / r² = (4/3 π G ρ) r.\n2) Since g_planet = g_earth, and ρ_planet = 2 ρ_earth, we have (4/3 π G ρ_planet) r_planet = (4/3 π G ρ_earth) r_earth.\n3) This simplifies to ρ_planet r_planet = ρ_earth r_earth.\n4) r_planet = (ρ_earth/ρ_planet) r_ = (1/2) r_earth.\n5) r_earth ≈ 6.371e6 m, takže r_planet = 6.371e6 / 2 ≈ 3.1855e6 m.\n6) Zaokrouhli na 3.19e6 m.\n\nAnswer: (B)"
