      "retried": false,
      "raw": "1) Energy of fall: E = m·g·h = 10⁻³·9,81·0.01 = 9.81e-05 J.\n2) Photon energy: E_ph = hc/λ = 6.626e-34·3e8/(6e-05) ≈ 3.313e-18 J.\n3) Number of photons: N = E/E_ph = 9.81e-05/3.313e-18 ≈ 2.96e14. Zaokrouhli na nejbližší celou číslici v tvoříte 3e14.\n\nAnswer: (H)"
